      "type": "source-note",
      "text": "An office in honour of Blessed Sacrament, traditionally recited on Thursdays in commemoration of the Last Supper when Jesus gave the world the Sacrament of His Body and Blood. The Latin text below is taken from a 1741 edition of the Coeleste Palmetum.",
      "pages": [
        54
      ],
      "language": "English"
    }
